+## Compare results for one business number
+
+Use the web dashboard for this task, including in your phone’s browser.
+
+In **Outbound**, open your voice campaigns and choose the number in the business-number filter. Choose a period. With one number selected, the cards cover all matching campaigns created in that period, including campaigns beyond the first page. Choose **All numbers** to return to the account view.
+
+**Pickup rate** is answered calls divided by all call attempts. For this measure, an answered call lasts over five seconds and has no detected voicemail. A call that failed to start counts as one unanswered attempt and adds zero minutes. One answered call lasting nine seconds and one failed start give a pickup rate of 50%. A dash means there are no attempts to measure. If the figures could not load, retry before reporting a result.
