+## Check delivery for one business number
+
+Use the web dashboard for this task, including in your phone’s browser.
+
+In **Outbound**, open SMS campaigns and choose the sending number. Select a period to include campaigns created during that period. The filtered cards combine every matching page. **Scheduled** counts future scheduled campaigns. **Messages sent** counts sends, **Delivery rate** divides delivered messages by delivered plus failed messages, and **Estimated segments** counts message parts. A sent text can still be waiting for a delivery result. Choose **All numbers** to return to the account view.
+
+To review people who asked this number to stop contacting them, open the [do-not-contact list](/guides/business/contact-controls). Choosing a number changes the view only. An opt-out can still protect a person across the whole account.
