+## Filter by the business number
+
+Send one owned business number in E.164 format, including the leading `+` (encode it as `%2B` in URLs). Omit `business_number` for the account view. A pending or inaccessible number returns `404 not_found`. Clear any previous page selection when changing the number.
+
+Set `include_totals=true` for six per-campaign fields: `total_calls`, `total_seconds`, `total_answered`, `today_calls`, `today_seconds`, `today_answered`. Omit it or send `false` for ordinary rows. Other values return `400 invalid_request`. Today means since the service’s start of day. Answered means a call longer than five seconds with no detected voicemail. Counts include unsuccessful starts as unanswered with zero seconds. A limit bounds rows returned, not the attempts counted for each row.
+
+```bash
+curl "https://api.nixflex.com/v1/campaigns?business_number=%2B12025550100&include_totals=true" \
+  -H "Authorization: Bearer $NIXFLEX_API_KEY"
+```
+
+Example totals from one returned campaign: `total_calls: 2`, `total_answered: 1`, `total_seconds: 9`.
+
+| Status | Filter error | Action |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| 400 | `invalid_business_number` | Send one international number with 7–15 digits, starting with a nonzero digit. |
+| 404 | `not_found` | Check the selected number belongs to this account and finished importing. |
+| 503 | `number_lookup_unavailable` | Retry the read. Keep the scope you selected. |
