+++ b/api-reference/contact-controls/correct-ai-opt-out.mdx
@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@
+---
+title: "Correct a mistaken AI-detected SMS opt-out"
+sidebarTitle: "Correct an AI opt-out"
+description: "Review an eligible AI-detected opt-out, provide its current review version and a reason, then verify the result before changing outbound contact."
+openapi: "/api-reference/public.openapi.json POST /contact-suppressions/ai-corrections"
+playground: "simple"
+canonical: "https://docs.nixflex.com/api-reference/contact-controls/correct-ai-opt-out"
+---
+
+Use this action only after reviewing the original incoming message and deciding the AI made a mistake. Use an organisation API key on your server. In the dashboard, only the Owner can correct the entry.
+
+## Request
+
+All four JSON fields are required. Extra fields return an error.
+
+| Field | Value |
+| --- | --- |
+| `phone_number` | Recipient’s E.164 number, with a leading plus and 7–15 digits. |
+| `channel` | Literal `all`. Recognition protects calls and texts across the account. |
+| `review_version` | UUID from the current eligible AI entry. |
+| `reason` | Nonblank text, 1–300 Unicode characters after trimming. |
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST "https://api.nixflex.com/v1/contact-suppressions/ai-corrections" \
+  -H "Authorization: Bearer $NIXFLEX_API_KEY" -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{"phone_number":"+12025550123","channel":"all","review_version":"e5cdb54a-7e27-42dc-b446-d31ebd35a2ff","reason":"The sender quoted an example."}'
+```
+
+## Response
+
+HTTP 200 identifies the exact recipient and scope corrected. A correction does not supply consent.
+
+```json
+{"removed":true,"phone_number":"+12025550123","channel":"all"}
+```
+
+## Errors and recovery
+
+| HTTP | Code | Action |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| 400 | `invalid_request` | Fix the fields or reason. |
+| 401 | `unauthorized`, `authentication_required` | Check the signed-in account or organisation key. |
+| 403 | `permission_denied` | A personal correction requires the Owner. |
+| 404 | `not_found` | Read the list again in the correct account. |
+| 409 | `review_changed` | Re-read the evidence and decide again using its new version. |
+| 409 | `suppression_locked` | An independent restriction still protects the recipient. Leave it in place. |
+| 429 | `rate_limit_exceeded` | Wait for the request limit to reset. |
+| 503 | `outcome_unknown` | The result carries `safe_to_retry: false`. Check the current entry before taking any further action. |
+
+There is no idempotency-key contract for this endpoint. Never automatically repeat a correction. [List opt-out evidence](/api-reference/contact-controls/get-contact-suppressions) · [Contact controls guide](/guides/developer/contact-controls).
